# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# prefs: factory
# setup: ideconnect
# board: discover
# Run and Save follow the desktop default, including changes while open.
#
# A board is CONNECTED from the desktop's Devices menu before any of
# this: finding one on the bus no longer mounts it, choosing it does.
# TikuBasic owns no connection menu or per-project destination.
wait 200
note the two boards on the bench, taken in from the Devices menu
click 264 8
wait 10
menu-pick nRF54L15
wait 300
click 264 8
wait 10
menu-pick nRF54LM20B
wait 300
note and the desktop is current on THIS machine again, so a project
note that names no board still runs here until it says otherwise
click 264 8
wait 10
menu-pick Default device:
wait 10
menu-pick This machine
wait 20
click 980 30
wait 10
menu-pick Programming
wait 10
menu-pick TikuBasic
wait 250
expect-title Project
click 71 8
wait 8
menu-pick Open Project…
wait 40
expect-title Open
click 400 220
wait 6
click 675 413
wait 60
expect-no-title Open
click-window Project
note opening a project does not start another device scan
wait 10
click 71 8
wait 8
expect-menu New Project…|Open Project…|Recover unsaved files||Run||Close Project|
click-window Project
wait 200
note runs go to this machine until a board is chosen
click 71 8
wait 8
expect-menu New Project…|Open Project…|Recover unsaved files||Run||Close Project|
click-window Project
wait 10
note change the desktop default while the project is open
click 264 8
wait 8
menu-pick Default device:
wait 8
expect-menu nrf54l15
expect-menu nrf54lm20b
menu-pick nrf54lm20b
wait 10
note and now Run says where it will go
click 71 8
wait 8
expect-menu Run on nrf54lm20b|Save on nrf54lm20b|
click-window Project
wait 10
note choosing this machine updates the open project's Run menu
click 264 8
wait 8
menu-pick Default device:
wait 8
menu-pick This machine
wait 10
click 71 8
wait 8
expect-menu New Project…|Open Project…|Recover unsaved files||Run||Close Project|
quit
